=== NATURAL ===
DEFINE DATA PARAMETER
1 #TITLE (A20)
1 #LOWER (A20)
END-DEFINE
EXAMINE #TITLE TRANSLATE INTO UPPER CASE
EXAMINE #LOWER TRANSLATE INTO LOWER CASE

=== PYTHON ===
class ExamineTranslateContext:
    def __init__(self):
        self.title = ""
        self.lower = ""

def execute_examine_translate(ctx: ExamineTranslateContext, session):
    ctx.title = ctx.title.upper()
    ctx.lower = ctx.lower.lower()
    return ctx

=== EXECUTE ===
- input:
    title: "Software AG Natural"
    lower: "UPPERCASE TEXT"
  expected:
    title: "SOFTWARE AG NATURAL"
    lower: "uppercase text"
